# Full-boot CI curated os-test extension (feat/os-test-400): +non-basic tests.
# Suite-prefixed paths; included by misc/ci-boot.tests. Every entry here is
# host-prebuilt (same recipe as prebuild-basic-smoke.sh) and must pass
# honestly on all boot arches — no xfails, no skip lists.
# Excluded on purpose (missing support; see SUITES.md "Deferred"):
#   limits/* compile-fail (limit macros not in newlib/myos sysroot),
#   pty/* compile-fail (pty suite APIs not ported),
#   signal/ppoll-block-*, signal/sigaltstack-exec* (ppoll/sigaltstack rolled
#   back with the 2026-09-21 networking regression rollback),
#   process/waitpid-pgid-* (waitpid(pgid) filtering unimplemented),
#   udp/* (UDP libc support rolled back; re-land as follow-up).

